  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/gorc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review (dev 100b6fbb6e, sherpa-onnx d7526c8): analyze_cpp gives 427 ambiguous edges at 420 sites (filed 424), led by ReadFile 166 and GetSessionOptions 121. Field-chain branch (cpp.py:2098-2123) still does resolver.lookup with no overload_choice; overload_choice declines explicit receivers by design (WI-lamij 261c7921d2). The InitKeywords example remains masked by WI-rugin (member template emitted as free function; a false self-call at impl.h:336, 0.85). MECHANISM: overload choice reads arity only; argument shapes unread; field-chain path takes no choice. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-rugin."  # ba9f
